[00:00.00] 作曲 : Peter Fenn/Jesse Fink
[00:00.00][by:stillworkingonit]
[00:05.58]Met her late in the summer
[00:05.58]夏末与她邂逅
[00:08.46]Asked her name and her number
[00:08.46]轻声问芳名与号码
[00:10.64]She said, "Whoa
[00:10.64]她惊呼 且慢
[00:13.50]Let's take it slow"
[00:13.50]不如缓缓来
[00:16.72]That stolen kiss by the river
[00:16.72]河畔那偷来的吻
[00:20.04]Made me shake, made me shiver
[00:20.04]令我颤抖 浑身发烫
[00:22.21]Down to my bones
[00:22.21]直抵骨髓深处
[00:24.92]But I need you more
[00:24.92]却更渴望你温度
[00:28.36]And I swore that I'd never fall in love again
[00:28.36]我曾发誓不再坠入爱河
[00:31.25]But when you talk like this and you look like that, I, I
[00:31.25]可当你如此低语 这般凝视 我
[00:35.02]I feel like gold
[00:35.02]恍若身披金光
[00:37.19]Electric love is running from my
[00:37.19]电流般的爱意流窜在
[00:40.80]Head to my toes
[00:40.80]发梢与脚尖
[00:43.02]Addicted to this feeling and I
[00:43.02]沉溺这悸动 我
[00:46.60]Won't let it go
[00:46.60]绝不放手
[00:48.78]You fell right out the sky
[00:48.78]你自天际坠落
